How to Transition into MLOps
If you’re a DevOps or SRE Engineer today, here’s how you can grow into MLOps:
 Strengthen your fundamentals — CI/CD, Docker, Kubernetes, Cloud (AWS/GCP/Azure).
 Learn ML basics — model training, testing, and deployment.
 Explore MLOps tools — MLflow, Airflow, Kubeflow, SageMaker.
 Build a small project — automate training + deployment using pipelines.
 Learn about model governance and drift monitoring — essential for production-grade ML.

Pro Tip:
If you already understand automation, scalability, and reliability — you’re halfway there!
MLOps is simply DevOps + Data + Model Lifecycle Management.
It’s one of the most in-demand transitions in the 2025 cloud world.
